This (hypothetical) group of scientists is interested in learning about the relationship between nutritional status and depression as an outcome. 

Vitamin D deficiency is commonly known to contribute to depression, and we would like to know if the NHANES data set supports this conclusion. We are also looking at fiber, sugar, saturated fat, and cholesterol consumption. 

```{r}
